    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## COVE2E Recovery\nHandles ATTACH_DOCUMENT, RESUBMIT_CLAIM and ATTACH_AND_RESUBMIT (any other action_type).\n\n- action_type = ATTACH_DOCUMENT: attach only, skip resubmit\n- action_type = RESUBMIT_CLAIM: skip attach, resubmit only\n- otherwise: attach every document, then resubmit\n\nValidation fails (HTTP 400, ok:false) when attaching is required and `documents` is empty or any document has validation_status INVALID.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460
      },
